# Set this to an address reachable from your device when testing API-backed features.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.10:3000

# Load events from the API instead of the built-in mock data.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_USE_EVENTS_API=true

# Call the organiser subscription/organisation endpoints instead of the local demo.
# The backend org and payments modules are not implemented yet.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_USE_ORGANISER_API=true

# Call the profile/settings endpoints (notification preferences, discovery preferences,
# saved organisers, reviews, business verification) instead of the local demo.
# The backend identity/notification modules are not implemented yet; switch off any
# feature in PROFILE_FEATURES (services/profileService.ts) whose endpoint hasn't shipped.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_USE_PROFILE_API=true
